{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This free demo of <i>Deaduction</i> lets you experience the eerie world of our multiplayer social deduction horror. Step into an abandoned hotel where up to six players must survive the night\u2014while one of you secretly hunts as a Poltergeist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26b0\ufe0f <strong>Key Features in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete hotel tasks</strong> \u2013 cook, garden, monitor security, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn money &amp; buy tools</strong> to protect yourself or expose the imposter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deception &amp; deduction</strong> \u2013 vote to eliminate who you believe is the Poltergeist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as staff or spirit</strong> \u2013 survive the night or terrorize the living with sinister powers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4049520?t=1759498663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049520/e5d095bad8f17b0a0deed73b5d0a145b359ff1ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759498663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049520/4dc053163661d5d99531724856f6b44cce8184f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759498663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4049520/4dc053163661d5d99531724856f6b44cce8184f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759498663","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This free demo of <i>Deaduction</i> lets you experience the eer